@@ -15,3 +15,7 @@ language.

 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Sites
+
+Set `X-Larder-Site` to a kitchen id. Requests default to `main`. An unknown id returns HTTP 400 with code `unknown_site`. Batch access, stock on hand, cooking, alerts, stock value and stock-takes use the selected kitchen. Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared.
