@@ -65,3 +65,7 @@ These hold for every record, however it was made.
 - Fridges must read at or below 5 °C and freezers at or below -15 °C. Each
   of them needs at least one reading per day.
 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## Sites
+
+Schema 3 adds a `sites` list with an id and name for each kitchen. Each location has a globally unique id and a `site` referencing its kitchen. Batches and stock-takes belong to the site of their location. Migration assigns existing locations to `main`.
